# Osteomancer Adept (CR 118.8, 601.2b, 701.61a, 611.2a): turn 1 Bot1 casts the Adept with a Mox and a Black Lotus, and Faithless Looting, which
# draws and discards Grizzly Bears and a Plains, leaving Black Lotus, Faithless Looting, Grizzly Bears and the Plains in the graveyard. On
# turn 3 the Adept taps: the Bears are cast from the graveyard by foraging - three cards of the graveyard exiled besides the Bears - paying
# their mana cost {1}{G}, and they enter with a finality counter on it, so they would be exiled if they died.

